    "overview": "Champak Steel and Engg. Co. is an established manufacturer, distributor, and exporter of Hollow Section. Square Hollow Section or simply SHS has a flat surface economical for joining and welding and thus requires minimal edge preparation. The hollows in SHS have a vacant space that is used effectively in industrial applications. The Square hollow section is available in grades such as EN, ASTM, GB, and JIS. They are also available in sizes between 2 mm and 30 mm in width and between 6 m and 12 m in length. We also manufacture the SHS in customized sizes as per our customerâ€™s requirement. IS 4923 YST 210 Square Hollow Section has some very good features like high tensile strength, good conductivity, good quality, easy installation, fire resistance, and waterproof. Due to its highly non-corrosive properties, it is mainly used for piping systems and marine applications. IS 4923 YST 310 Square Hollow Section is also a non-corrosive and fire-resistant material. The IS 4923 YST 310 Square Hollow Section is made from high-quality materials. Our IS 4983 YST 310 Hollow Section are appreciated by our clients for their ease in installation and properties such as good conductivity and high tensile strength. The IS 4983 YST 355 grade can be produced in either a seamless or welded manner. These grade hollow sections are the most reliable and low-cost solution in high-temperature service applications. The EN 10210 S355J2H Hollow Section can withstand elevated temperature, is reliable, durable for various applications. The dimensional consistency, the higher degree of formability, is due to the complete killing of steel with greater weldability. The Square Hollow Section is used in various industries such as chemical, oil mills, petrochemical, mining, refineries, nuclear power, breweries, fertilizers, railway, construction, offshore, power plant, shipbuilding, steel plant, oil & gas, paper, ports, defense, cement, sugar, etc.",
